.DS_Store

# Vendor documents are retained locally for engineering reference. Keep their
# original files and generated full-text copies out of a future public commit
# unless their redistribution status has been reviewed.
docs/datasheets/**/*.pdf
docs/datasheets/**/*.md
docs/datasheets/**/*.assets/
docs/datasheets/**/*.lock.json
!docs/datasheets/**/README.md

# Reference manuals follow the same local-only policy as vendor data sheets.
docs/manuals/**/*.pdf
docs/manuals/**/*.md
docs/manuals/**/*.assets/
docs/manuals/**/*.lock.json
!docs/manuals/**/README.md
